<Base title="About" activePage="about">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="body-text">
    <p>
      I'm a second-year PhD student at ETH Zurich and a research student at Mercedes-Benz working on video generation
      and world models, with a focus on autonomous driving. I am open to research collaborations. Feel free to drop me an email! 
    <p>
      Outside research, I make minimal and deep electronic music. I believe in minimalism as methodology: in
      research, in music, in how I structure my tools and my time.
    </p>
    <p>
      I was born and raised in Azerbaijan, since 2016 I have lived in Hungary, South Korea, and Switzerland making many memories and friends.
    </p>
